  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian protection and safeguarding - Ukraine and Neighboring Countries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Institutional capacity, composition, and commitment to address violence, discrimination, and exclusion (Safeguarding focus).
2. National Societies and the IFRC adopt a comprehensive Protection, Gender, and Inclusion approach across all operations, programmes, and services (PGI focus). 
3. Develop and improve advocacy, partnerships, and learning within the Red Cross Red Crescent Movement and externally to support better protection, gender, and inclusion actions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hungary, Georgia and Poland.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLRC through the PGI advisor expert (Antonietta Romano) provide technical support and coordination to IFRC, PGI Working Group, and HNS in Hungary, Georgia and Poland.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">request from the PGI team in Budapest and coordination with the WASH team to raise better protection in WASH and other relevant field</narrative>
  </description>
